    "The recommendations seem to stretch my hardware interest into a broad interest in household and workplace supplies.",
    "Sharing a word or material, such as hooks or magnets, seems to count too much when the actual mounting method and use differ."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My recent fasteners and magnetic hooks suggest that compatibility, secure attachment and practical holding uses matter to me right now.",
    "I rarely choose something without a clear immediate use: the screw-mounted cup magnets give me that reason, while the plain discs only catch my interest."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations partly understood my interest in magnets and fasteners but extended it too broadly beyond practical hardware needs."
